topic moves beyond one logo into coordinated visual language."}, {"id": "74a7e058-148b-4583-a3e1-029076b5725b", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Brand applications", "children": [{"id": "8b6d5823-e1c4-4b59-b765-fbb6d5c6fb65", "type": "concept", "title": "Business cards"}, {"id": "d2e8b293-8930-44db-8d5c-e67dd2fe13f5", "type": "concept", "title": "Social posts"}, {"id": "f144444a-40e7-4066-a337-47124bd1c4cc", "type": "concept", "title": "Packaging"}, {"id": "5cfa6461-2b1d-4de3-a1c4-39c9dbce2fed", "type": "concept", "title": "Signage"}], "description": "Students test identities across real contexts."}]}, {"id": "6c84bc33-49c2-428a-8a8c-50a84ec53266", "type": "topic", "title": "Information Design, Data, Diagrams, and Visual Systems", "description": "Students learn to organize information clearly, especially when complexity must become understandable at a glance.", "children": [{"id": "17a5bbcf-7003-4319-9d59-0d77520bb784", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Information hierarchy", "children": [{"id": "973f02b2-4c71-4f38-b868-8dafda9b7e24", "type": "concept", "title": "Labels"}, {"id": "e19e7594-4f93-4d31-b8c7-a7ed3c946372", "type": "concept", "title": "Grouping"}, {"id": "3a4ce084-5d57-4db6-bb3e-c201cf3e1c73", "type": "concept", "title": "Ordering"}, {"id": "bb0e1cbc-e8c7-4793-8a12-fd63816d33ff", "type": "concept", "title": "Progressive disclosure"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces structured data, categories, relationships, and priority."}, {"id": "9b0843bb-d4df-42cd-955a-5f1d599f6448", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Diagrams and maps", "children": [{"id": "b27ff729-1913-461f-9e7d-0111b09a7fe5", "type": "concept", "title": "Flowcharts"}, {"id": "d947a71b-666d-4b3b-8c15-96c2103e7b97", "type": "concept", "title": "Timelines"}, {"id": "ce4b4360-818b-4bc4-8b31-fd76e7d3d4c7", "type": "concept", "title": "Wayfinding"}, {"id": "5f83ee56-f265-459d-bc3d-ec861bb6b989", "type": "concept", "title": "Concept maps"}], "description": "Students translate processes, places, and systems into visual explanations."}, {"id": "21107422-fe3c-43e4-8cc1-3b8cfd61d924", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Data visualization basics", "children": [{"id": "62750f97-9d07-4380-bdc2-5781d7226ec2", "type": "concept", "title": "Bar charts"}, {"id": "26529459-9ed8-4c21-849d-76c48d17b340", "type": "concept", "title": "Line charts"}, {"id": "27764537-1256-4e8a-9b5d-a32648ef5af8", "type": "concept", "title": "Comparison"}, {"id": "eab0f00e-0de7-4e46-927c-fde7729991ce", "type": "concept", "title": "Annotation"}], "description": "Students practice matching data type to visual form responsibly."}]}, {"id": "aff6030d-b9dc-4edc-8873-3a6f05ca5873", "type": "topic", "title": "Web, Interactive, UX, and Accessible Digital Design", "description": "Introductory graphic design now includes screen-based communication, usability, and inclusive interaction.", "children": [{"id": "4cdf87a3-8597-4af6-8888-88d9a22dfb11", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Interface fundamentals", "children": [{"id": "34b1309c-54ab-4abb-991e-a3a13dae200f", "type": "concept", "title": "Screens"}, {"id": "e43b172c-b5c7-4b70-8fa3-d99394abf86c", "type": "concept", "title": "Navigation"}, {"id": "3a8c99ca-4b81-4c1a-99a6-9ed45f42f70e", "type": "concept", "title": "Buttons"}, {"id": "b4adcdb4-c4ed-4049-ab2f-c0e7fb17d5c4", "type": "concept", "title": "Cards"}], "description": "Students learn the basic visual language of digital products."}, {"id": "8acea33c-0bcc-4227-99d2-c47356389027", "type": "subtopic", "title": "User-centered thinking", "children": [{"id": "c3aabd97-28b2-40f3-8b97-f170978200ab", "type": "concept", "title": "User goals"}, {"id": "df4b861a-01f2-4680-aaec-846a55fab858", "type": "concept", "title": "Personas"}, {"id": "d48a9739-5e8a-4d04-9f67-2672167e2583", "type": "concept", "title": "Journey maps"}, {"id": "628557ab-6fff-42cf-a469-c771c75e8c34", "type": "concept", "title": "Usability testing"}], "description": "This subtopic introduces research, personas, flows, and testing."}, {"id": "1fa6a475-625d-4